mapping "W3402.1" source="W3402" target="218081007" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target quality=100 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W3402 is a Swedish ICD-10-SE extension of base WHO code W34 (Discharge from other and
        unspecified firearms) with suffixes encoding place (home and residential area) and activity
        (paid work). WHO W34 crosswalks via Athena to SNOMED CT 437167 (Accident caused by firearm missile,
        218081007). SE place/activity suffixes have no separate SNOMED CT standard concept; 437167 fully
        subsumes the clinical firearm-discharge accident. Confidence (high): crosswalk-verified, small
        breadth mismatch from SE extension.
        """
}
